risks of uneven bite, unintended tooth movement, pain, and tooth loss」とし、対面診察はかみ合わせの乱れ、意図しない歯の移動、痛み、歯の喪失のリスクを減らすのに役立つとしています。装着後も定期的に対面受診し、予定どおり安全に動いているか確認する必要があります。両方とも規制文書で、問題発生率は示していません。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国家药品监督管理局医疗器械技术审评中心 (2022). 无托槽矫治器注册审查指导原则（2022 年第 41 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cmde.org.cn/flfg/zdyz/zdyzwbk/20230103095116100.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cmde.org.cn/flfg/zdyz/zdyzwbk/20230103095116100.html"]},"；国家卫生健康委办公厅等 (2023). 关于进一步推进口腔医疗服务和保障管理工作的通知（国卫办医政发〔2023〕11 号，第五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202309/content_6903786.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202309/content_6903786.htm"]},"；U.S. Food and Drug Administration (2026). Clear Dental Aligners（页面 2026 年 9 月 9 日更新）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/dental-devices/clear-dental-aligners","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/dental-devices/clear-dental-aligners"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cmde.org.cn/flfg/zdyz/zdyzwbk/20230103095116100.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["発生率が見つからず、結果から判断するしかないため、利益の規模は小としています。中国の薬品監督・衛生健康部門による、自宅でネット購入の装置を使うことへの警告は見つからず、登録要件と FDA の説明が中心です。矯正は医療行為で、美容医療として行うなら施設の許可に該当診療科目があり、医師にも資格が必要です。調べ方は本節第2項（施設許可、担当医）を参照してください。4 部門の 2023 年の歯科医療通知も、無許可施設や非医療専門職に診療させる行為の厳罰を求めています。矯正は医療保険の対象外です。第24節第12項（インプラント前に総額の範囲を確認）を参照してください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/28-08"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"もし「自分が醜い」と感じる程度が、何度も鏡を見たり、何度も修正したいと考えたりするレベルに達しているなら、手術を検討する前に、まずボディイメージの評価を受けること"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/28-02"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["注射、糸リフト、手術の前に確認すべき2つのこと：施設の許可証に「医療美容」の記載があるか、施術者が主治医であるか"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["針やメスを使用し、医療機器を用い、皮膚を傷つけたり体内に入れたりする行為は、すべて診療にあたります。許可証に「医療美容」と記載されている施…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/28